WEBVTT

00:07:31.614 --> 00:07:35.034
We all have a stake in this conversation
about technologies.

00:07:36.285 --> 00:07:42.082
Can we actively align machines
to better reflect our biological reality?

00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:47.254
I sincerely hope that you'll consider

00:07:47.296 --> 00:07:51.133
that machines can be so much more
than what we've known,

00:07:51.133 --> 00:07:54.970
and how they might embody
a wisdom drawn from biology.

00:07:56.639 --> 00:07:59.975
This project is a project for everybody,